Hey, I'm Sreehari. I like messing around with pretty much anything systems-level,
so you'll see me doing a lot of OS development.

I believe that everyone deserves to have
[software that they can love](https://kristoff.it/blog/the-open-source-game/),
rather than software that they are forced to use due to the lack of better alternatives.
Being a founder at [Frostium Technologies](https://frostium.org), I am committed to
building tools that truly serve the end user.
